WEBVTT

00:00.522 --> 00:03.411
I’ll show you how to take
the powder in your hand.

00:03.411 --> 00:03.937
Look here.

00:03.937 --> 00:04.987
Take it like this.

00:04.987 --> 00:07.089
Now take it like this in your hand.

00:07.089 --> 00:10.767
Then see—when you put it on,
you have to do it drop by drop.

00:10.767 --> 00:11.817
Like this, like this.

00:11.817 --> 00:13.919
Don’t put it on this side like this.

00:13.919 --> 00:14.444
Like this.

00:14.444 --> 00:14.970
Like this.

00:14.970 --> 00:18.648
You can place it however you want,
but you have to do it slowly.

00:18.648 --> 00:19.436
Try putting it.

00:19.436 --> 00:21.800
Is this much okay if you take this much?

00:21.800 --> 00:23.902
You can take as much as you want.

00:23.942 --> 00:25.553
But you have to apply it drop by drop.

00:25.553 --> 00:26.448
Your thumb is big, right?

00:26.448 --> 00:27.702
Put just a little at a time.
